# GatewayLM Project Context

Full context lives in `AGENTS.md`. Highlights:

## What We're Building
Production LLM API gateway — auth, rate limiting, budget enforcement, provider fallback, observability. Python 3.11 + FastAPI + Redis + OpenTelemetry.

## Strict Rules
- One commit per ticket. Format: `[P{phase}-T{ticket}] description`
- Update `docs/doc.md` status when a ticket is done
- Type annotations on every function — no untyped signatures
- `async def` for all route handlers and I/O functions
- Pydantic models for all data crossing boundaries
- No bare `except:` — catch specific exceptions only

## File Ownership
- `models/schemas.py` — canonical types only, no business logic
- `providers/` — one file per provider, no middleware logic
- `middleware/` — pure request/response concerns, no provider logic
- `config/` — loading and validation only

## Architecture Flow
Request → Auth middleware → Rate limit → Budget check → Router → Provider adapter → Response → Observability

